    "product_description": [
      {
        "value": "<p>Experience the universe from the comfort of your home with the Galaxy Moon Lamp, a unique night light that brings the cosmos to your bedside. This enchanting lamp is perfect for anyone looking to add a touch of celestial magic to their room.</p><p><b>Benefits:</b></p><p>Creates a soothing atmosphere, perfect for relaxation or bedtime.</p><p>Offers customizable mood settings with various light modes.</p><p>Enhances any room with beautiful, vibrant colors.<br></p><p><b>Features:</b></p><p><b>16 different color options</b> for personalized light settings.</p><p><b>Remote contro</b>l for easy adjustments from anywhere in the room.</p><p><b>Improved battery life</b> for extended enjoyment without frequent recharges.</p><p><b>Designed with safety in mind</b> to ensure peaceful nights without concerns.</p><p><b>Available in multiple sizes and two stylish stand colors:</b> chic light brown and playful pink.<br></p><p>This lamp isn't just a light; it's an experience, ideal for gifting or personalizing your bedroom, study, or living space. Explore the possibilities and let your space shine with personality and light. Discover more and let your imagination soar with the Galaxy Moon Lamp.</p>",
        "language_tag": "en_US",
