    "bullet_point": [
      {
        "value": "Experience Cosmic Magic at Home: Transform any room into a starlit galaxy with our Galaxy Lamp, creating an immersive, celestial ambiance that sparks the imagination. Available in sizes from 4.7\" to 8.0\", find the perfect fit for your space and control it your way—touch or remote.",
        "language_tag": "en_US",
        "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
      },
      {
        "value": "Illuminate Your Adventures: Light up the fun with our Galaxy Lamp—perfect for reading, relaxing, or just dreaming. The vibrant, customizable colors set the scene for any adventure, turning every moment into a celestial experience. Comfort in the Dark: Help your child feel secure at night with the Galaxy Lamp's soothing light.",
        "language_tag": "en_US",
        "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
      },
      {
        "value": "Equipped with a multi-stage dimmer and auto-off timer, it ensures a peaceful sleep, easing the fear of the dark with its gentle, calming presence.",
        "language_tag": "en_US",
        "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
      },
      {
        "value": "Perfect Gift for Dreamy Nights: Delight any girl with the Galaxy Lamp, an enchanting gift that turns bedrooms into cosmic retreats. Designed with care, it features cool-to-the-touch LEDs and a splinter-free wood stand available in honey brown or playful pink.",
        "language_tag": "en_US",
        "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
      },
      {
        "value": "Superior Safety and Quality: Mind-Glowing stands out with safer, superior materials. Our lamps are BPA-free, feature long-lasting batteries, and come with a 4-year extended warranty, unlike others that may offer shorter life spans and less reliability.",
        "language_tag": "en_US",
        "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
      }
    ],
